  <Intro>k__BackingField: Saint Ardo was buried with an amulet that keeps the dead in their graves. In the right hands it does the opposite. The abbey still guards his tomb, and the clans have heard there is gold in it.
  <Outro>k__BackingField: The amulet is cold to the touch, and the saint is no longer resting. He kneels.
  <Goal>k__BackingField: Find the Amulet of the Grave in the saint's tomb.
